OCMAT 1
# M_LabRubber: a plain lab material naming the physical surface Rubber.
SHADER standard
BLEND opaque
CULL back
FLAGS twosided=0 castshadow=1

PARAM baseColorFactor 0.120 0.120 0.140 1.0
PARAM metallicFactor 0.0
PARAM roughnessFactor 0.7
PARAM emissiveFactor 0.0 0.0 0.0
PARAM normalScale 1.0
PARAM occlusionStrength 1.0

PHYSSURFACE Rubber
